{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1725", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1725/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1725/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1725/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1725", "id": 1175644133, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s5GEufl", "number": 1725, "title": "Change libmavsdk third party libs installation path", "user": {"login": "BestITUserEUW", "id": 56920372, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTIwMzcy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56920372?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW", "html_url": "https://github.com/BestITUserEUW", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2022-03-21T16:36:04Z", "updated_at": "2022-03-22T11:11:08Z", "closed_at": "2022-03-22T11:11:08Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hey,\r\ni'm currently trying to build the mavsdk library from source, and include it in my own project but i am having issues with changing the CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX for third party libs in mavsdk. I'm building mavsdk with https://github.com/dockcross/dockcross toolchain and the following cmakeList:\r\ncmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.1)\r\n\r\nproject(external-MAVSDK)\r\ninclude(ExternalProject)\r\n\r\nlist(APPEND CMAKE_ARGS\r\n    \"-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX:PATH=${CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX}\"\r\n    \"-DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE:PATH=${CMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE}\"\r\n    \"-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=${CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE}\"\r\n    \"-DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=OFF\"\r\n    \"-DBUILD_TESTS=OFF\"\r\n)\r\n\r\nmessage(STATUS \"Preparing external project \\\"MAVSDK\\\" with args:\")\r\nforeach(CMAKE_ARG ${CMAKE_ARGS})\r\n    message(STATUS \"-- ${CMAKE_ARG}\")\r\nendforeach()\r\n\r\nExternalProject_add(\r\n    MAVSDK\r\n    GIT_REPOSITORY https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK.git\r\n    PREFIX MAVSDK\r\n    GIT_TAG v1.0.8\r\n    CMAKE_ARGS \"${CMAKE_ARGS}\"\r\n)\r\nbut the problem is that the third party libs from MAVSDK are being installed in:\r\n`/work/build/third_party/MAVSDK/MAVSDK/src/MAVSDK-build/third_party/install`\r\ninstead of where the other libraries being installed in:\r\n`/work/build/third_party/install/include`\r\nI don't know if this is a problem but i am getting the following error when trying to find the MAVSDK package:\r\n\r\n  Make Error at /usr/share/cmake-3.21/Modules/CMakeFindDependencyMacro.cmake:47 (find_package):\r\n  Could not find a package configuration file provided by \"CURL\" with any of\r\n  the following names:\r\n\r\n    CURLConfig.cmake\r\n    curl-config.cmake\r\n\r\n  Add the installation prefix of \"CURL\" to CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH or set\r\n  \"CURL_DIR\" to a directory containing one of the above files.  If \"CURL\"\r\n  provides a separate development package or SDK, be sure it has been\r\n  installed.\r\nCall Stack (most recent call first):\r\n  build/third_party/install/lib/cmake/MAVSDK/MAVSDKConfig.cmake:7 (find_dependency)\r\n  src/drone/CMakeLists.txt:7 (find_package)\r\n\r\n\r\nall the other third party library dependencies are being found in the install path. help would be appreciated.\r\nI already tried adding \r\n`include directorys(/work/build/third_party/MAVSDK/MAVSDK/src/MAVSDK-build/third_party/install)`\r\nbut that didn't change anything.", "closed_by": {"login": "BestITUserEUW", "id": 56920372, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTIwMzcy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56920372?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW", "html_url": "https://github.com/BestITUserEUW", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/BestITUserEUW/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1725/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1725/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.c